#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-trimble-px1.rst:8
#: 62479c5694eb4d39aa78a6a92170605a 6e3a2f4620784a3eb3b55f2582894d9a
#: 93e0488a3c6a4933a011dbecd10cc40b cfd5c119483541e4b352d9d73a3e6e52
#: fb05b27e08e44fa9a2896a32ed454627
msgid ""
"The Trimble PX-1 RTX is a relatively expensive but also highly accurate RTX "
"GNSS+INS. It supports corrections from a satellite or cellular network "
"through `CenterPoint® RTX Correction service "
"<https://positioningservices.trimble.com/en/rtx>`__. RTX provides centimeter"
" accuracy without the use of a base station. Although the PX-1 is designed "
"to be used as an external inertial navigation system, it is also supported "
"for use as a strict GPS in ArduPilot. Detailed `information from the "
"manufacturer can be found here "
"<https://advancedairmobility.trimble.com/>`__."
msgstr ""
"Trimble PX-1 RTX 是价格较高但精度极高的 RTX GNSS+INS。它支持通过 `CenterPoint® RTX 校正服务 "
"<https://positioningservices.trimble.com/en/rtx>`__ "
"从卫星或蜂窝网络获取校正信号，无需基站即可实现厘米级精度。虽然 PX-1 设计为外部惯性导航系统，但在 ArduPilot 中也支持作为纯 GPS "
"使用。`制造商详细信息请点击此处 <https://advancedairmobility.trimble.com/>`__。"

